    title: "the SCIP/tree-sitter coexistence design is cited to ADR-0012, which contains no SCIP ruling; the spec calls it settled, the vision doc calls it open, and a second backend is being planned on the citation"  # 9f1a
    status: needs_human_review  # 9f1a
